1
00:00:02,490 --> 00:00:08,914
Prior auth. Still a fax in most practices.

2
00:00:08,914 --> 00:00:13,205
Pick the patient. The payer comes with them.

3
00:00:13,206 --> 00:00:17,202
Say what you are asking them to cover.

4
00:00:17,202 --> 00:00:21,644
It carries the codes, so the payer is answering the right question.

5
00:00:21,644 --> 00:00:24,267
Sent to the clearinghouse. Not to a fax tray.

6
00:00:24,267 --> 00:00:26,871
And it sits on a queue with a status until they answer.
